    "ciphertext": "~022078886078900352774",
    "description": "I need an experienced developer to add a payment module to my existing website built with Next.js and TypeScript. This is a small, well-defined task with clear scope. Good work here can lead to future contracts on the same project.\nProject Scope\nPayment Integration: Integrate Stripe Checkout for one-time payments on healthcare services page\nCheckout Flow: Payment button → Stripe hosted checkout → redirect back to site\nWebhook: Single webhook to confirm successful payment and handle failures\nPages: Success and cancel/failure pages\nSecurity: No card data touches our servers, Stripe hosted checkout only\nTesting: Full flow tested in Stripe test mode first, then live keys deployed\n\nTech Stack\nNext.js (App Router), TypeScript. You will work in an existing codebase.\n\nWorking payment flow on production\nWebhook configured and verified\nShort handover note (env vars, Stripe dashboard settings)\n\nRequirements\n\nProven Stripe integration experience\nClean, documented code.\nClear communication and delivery within timeline",
